      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;is a reducing agent.",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fq4wi",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi></math> to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Sn</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mzIfl",
      "text": "A solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;ions.",
      "isCorrect": false,
