      "text": "The reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Pb</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> with hot dilute nitric acid to give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is a redox reaction.",
      "isCorrect": false,
